cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1740788/425f497f-9c72-4a14-9033-6b31b02a2229.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1740788/425f497f-9c72-4a14-9033-6b31b02a2229.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"This beautifully furnished 3.5-room apartment offers everything you need for comfortable, hassle-free living. The apartment is fully equipped and furnished, allowing you to move in and feel at home right away. A particular highlight is the balcony with beautiful panoramic views, providing a private outdoor space to relax and unwind.\nFrom the upstairs bedroom you can see Heidelberg.\nThe apartment also features a new, modern fitted kitchen.\n\nAs the two bedrooms are completely separate and located on different levels, the apartment is ideally suited for a family with children as well as for a shared apartment (WG). Subletting is permitted upon agreement.\n\nThe apartment is rented on an all-inclusive basis (warm rent) unless otherwise agreed. You do not need to arrange or register electricity, waste collection or internet yourself. The all-inclusive package includes:\n\n- Bedroom 1: Double bed and wardrobe\n- Bedroom 2: Two single beds (can be replaced with a double bed before move-in upon request) and a walk-in wardrobe/storage room\n- Dining area\n- Home office/workspace with desk\n- Fully equipped kitchen including dishes and kitchenware\n- Bathroom with bathtub and shower, washing machine and dryer in the bathroom (use of the shared laundry room is also possible)\n- All operating costs, including electricity, hot and cold water, heating, waste collection, etc.\n- WiFi (100 Mbit/s)\n- Cable TV and broadcasting fee\n- Private, well-maintained and dry basement storage room with a lockable door and practical shelving system\n- Two parking spaces: one directly at the entrance of the building and one in the underground garage\n- Pets upon agreement\n\nlocated in an excellent area: the Walldorf Office Park (SAP), as well as grocery stores, town center, playgrounds, nature are all within a few minutes’ walk. Bus stop with direct connection to Wiesloch/Walldorf train station located right infront of the building. Autobahn 2 min drive, Heidelberg 20min.","facilities":{"airConditioning":{"value":"no"},"allergyFriendly":{"value":"yes"},"balconyTerrace":{"value":"private"},"basement":{"value":"private"},"bathroom":{"value":"private"},"bed":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomFurnished":{"value":"yes"},"bedroomLock":{"value":"yes"},"bedrooms":{"value":"2"},"closet":{"value":"yes"},"couplesAllowed":{"value":"yes"},"desk":{"value":"yes"},"dishwasher":{"value":"yes"},"dryer":{"value":"yes"},"electricityCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"flooring":{"value":"wood"},"garden":{"value":"no"},"gasCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"heating":{"value":"central"},"internetCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"kitchen":{"value":"private"},"kitchenware":{"value":"private"},"livingRoom":{"value":"private"},"parking":{"value":"private"},"pets":{"value":"discussable"},"playMusic":{"value":"discussable"},"registrationPossible":{"value":"yes"},"roomFurniture":{"value":"yes"},"smoking":{"value":"outside_only"},"toilet":{"value":"private"},"totalSize":{"value":"70"},"tv":{"value":"yes"},"washingMachine":{"value":"yes"},"waterCostIncluded":{"value":"yes"},"wheelchairAccessible":{"value":"no"},"wifi":{"value":"yes"}},"costs":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":189000,"deposit":189000,"agencyFee":0,"estimatedBills":0},"costsFormatted":{"currency":"EUR","pricing":"monthly","price":"1890.00","deposit":"1890.00","agencyFee":"0.00","estimatedBills":"0.00"},"minimumStayMonths":1,"moveInWindow":0,"currentOccupancy":0,"minAge":0,"maxAge":0,"preferredGender":"","available":[{"to":"9999-12-31","from":"2026-09-17"}],"updated"